PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
38-turn game. XMG's Elphidran Aqua/Pengullet destroyed Zutilt10's Lamball/Univolt early (turn 1). Zutilt10's Reptyro (1500) destroyed XMG's Elphidran Aqua (turn 2), but XMG's Lyleen Noct (1700) destroyed Reptyro right back (turn 3); Pengullet chipped Zutilt10 for 1 (10->9 life). Several XMG attacks (Suzaku, Lyleen Noct, Astegon, Bushi, Chillet) were nullified across the game by Zutilt10's deep interrupt suite (Reindrix x3, Cryolinx x3, Foxparks, Bushi x2). Reptyro Cryst destroyed two of XMG's blockers via combat (Elphidran Aqua turn 14, Lyleen Noct turn 18, mutually trading itself the second time). XMG built a Grappling Gun soul-engine and eventually ground Zutilt10 down via Pengullet/Astegon/Chillet chip damage (9->7->4->2->0), closing with a Pengullet hit for the final 2.


